  "changes": [
    "Blueprint shared receipt contract fixed before schema/code changes. Closed original key formats, seven existing responsibility states, S9 bidirectional candidate/final key-status constraints and consumer/work-complete invariants.",
    "Unaccepted S9 candidate public receipt now reports named not_accepted instead of an empty status; query has no Runtime/journal mutation.",
    "Actual S5/S7/S8/S9 Hook receipt JSON is validated before any reduced test struct decoding; public S9 final Result receipt JSON is validated directly.",
    "Concurrent original final submissions, exact old-request replay and stale unaccepted staging after a legitimate sibling workspace prepare are verified through original writers.",
    "Original S9 Worker prepare refuses unavailable isolation before any preparing/ready CAS or Worker materialization; ignored Main context staging is allowed.",
    "L4 13.11 non-pass blocker/resume design is fixed but its new receipt/schema/capability/Hook/lifecycle code is not implemented by this evidence."
  ],
